blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi,\n\nanother little fuzziness in pgsql\\Schema.php.\n\nIn method findColumns() the sequence name is resolved by this regex:\n<code>/nextval('\\w+'(::regclass)?)/</code> on <code>$column->defaultValue</code>\n\nThis only supports names in single qoutes (<code>'</code>). For table names or column names with upper cases, pgsql uses single quotes plus double qoutes (<code>'\"Some_Name\"'</code>) for the default value string. \n\nExample:\n<code>nextval('\"tbl_Partner_ID_seq\"'::regclass)</code>\n\nTo get the regex match both variants, i changed it to \n<code>/nextval('\\\"?\\w+\\\"?'(::regclass)?)/</code>\n\nThank you for your great work on yii2,\nSascha\n","closed_by":{"login":"qiangxue","id":993322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5MzMyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/993322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue","html_url":"https://github.com/qiangxue","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/1096/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/1096/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"